## Tool: Write

Creates or overwrites a file at the given path with the provided content. Use this to create new files or completely replace existing file content. For targeted edits to specific lines within existing files, use the Edit tool instead.

IMPORTANT: Before writing to a new directory, verify the directory path exists using ls (Bash tool) first.

